      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "In its desperation to gulp down food, it forgets about the food it has hidden under its fur.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "It conceals food under the long fur on its body. It carts around this food stash and swallows it without chewing.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "It needs to consume its own weight in food every day. As far as flavor is concerned, it’s indifferent.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it finds something that looks like it might be edible, it goes right ahead and swallows it whole. That’s why it gets fatter day by day.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "It hides food under its long fur, but it sometimes forgets about it and causes a stinky disturbance.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Anything that looks edible, Munchlax will go on and swallow whole. Its stomach is tough enough to handle it even if the food has gone rotten.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stuffing itself with vast amounts of food is its only concern. Whether the food is rotten or fresh, yummy or tasteless—it does not care.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It stores food beneath its fur. It might share just one bite, but only if it really trusts you.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its robust stomach allows it to nonchalantly devour even rotted matter. It pays frequent visits to villages, seeking out food scraps intended for compost.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
